[{"client_msg_id":"5e0d5a6b-54f3-4eb4-bb57-804513ad1c3b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"広く使われてて機能が多くて歴史があるプラグイン……","ts":"1635770660.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qpp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09a9b016-97f2-441c-96be-b969806d5aea","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"メンテ大変そう","ts":"1635770638.161400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RiP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef55035e-4a70-4ea7-b24b-2001e1b42417","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"てかNERDTreeってWTFPLだったの初めて知った","ts":"1635770517.161200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5itYL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"028cee95-f793-4be0-9564-e2b2776a3765","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"たいへんそう","ts":"1635770350.160200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6xRs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2f96bea-da16-4058-8504-d5ebf7f9a0d0","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/preservim/nerdtree/issues/1280\u003e\nNERDTreeがメンテナ募集中なり","ts":"1635770314.159800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/preservim/nerdtree/issues/1280|#1280 Help Wanted: New Collaborator\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/preservim/nerdtree/issues/1280|#1280 Help Wanted: New Collaborator\u003e","text":"*What?*\n\nWith this issue I am announcing my retirement from *NERDTree*. It's been a good six years, full of many enhancements and fixes for this much-loved plugin, but it's time for me to move on.\n\n*Why?*\n\n1. I'm tired, and I've been procrastinating other things.\n2. Every application has an expiration date, and *NERDTree* has many years left in it. But Vim 8+ and Neovim have introduced new capabilities that other authors have exploited to write very good alternatives - plugins whose features *NERDTree* would have a very difficult time assimilating. In a very real sense, *NERDTree* is the inspiration for many similar plugins that came after it. It may be time to pass the torch. You may disagree with me. That's OK; I'm not offended. All I ask is that you get involved if you think *NERDTree* should continue.\n3. I have noticed that as I took on more responsibility as maintainer, participation from the user community fell off in both the discussion of issues and the authoring of pull requests. My hope is that trend will reverse itself as I step away.\n\n*Now What?*\n\nIf you are interested in becoming a collaborator, leave a comment below. I will continue monitoring this thread, and will make appropriate evaluations of interested parties. \u003chttps://github.com/scrooloose|@scrooloose\u003e, \u003chttps://github.com/lifecrisis|@lifecrisis\u003e, and \u003chttps://github.com/alerque|@alerque\u003e, I invite you to weigh in, as well.\n\nThanks,  \nPhil","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"6","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/preservim/nerdtree|preservim/nerdtree\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1635479852}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HDX6o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f82a5a02-1a8e-49b7-9161-53013cf3b68e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"久し振りにddc.vimの記事を発見した","ts":"1635766088.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U01G63H9VN3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rIX8+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab704f6c-e928-4399-a5a3-1d17bc3771bd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://alpacat.com/blog/neovim-ddc-lsp-completion|https://alpacat.com/blog/neovim-ddc-lsp-completion\u003e","ts":"1635766070.158400","attachments":[{"fallback":"NeoVim+ddc.vimでLSPを使ってコード補完するための設定例","id":1,"title":"NeoVim+ddc.vimでLSPを使ってコード補完するための設定例","title_link":"https://alpacat.com/blog/neovim-ddc-lsp-completion","text":"NeoVim+ddc.vim環境でLanguage Serverを使ってコード補完を行うための設定例を紹介します。","thumb_url":"https://alpacat.com/og-image.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"alpacat.com","service_icon":"https://alpacat.com/favicon.ico","thumb_width":718,"thumb_height":378,"from_url":"https://alpacat.com/blog/neovim-ddc-lsp-completion","original_url":"https://alpacat.com/blog/neovim-ddc-lsp-completion"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kp4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a2c019-702c-4acd-b0be-fc342ef9a270","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"そっかcopilot#Accept()する\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;マッピング作ればいいのか","ts":"1635731601.157700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z1TZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8d61f35-3759-492c-b995-d030e205ca50","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"その場合exprマッピングでcopilot#Accept()が評価される前に補完消しまで済ませておかないといけないので……","ts":"1635731545.156800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/s8k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2780c6d2-21d6-4eaa-a9b4-310c9ba96998","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完消しも一緒にマッピングしてしまえばよさそう","ts":"1635731157.154800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X0yj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FA6A7B77-D5EB-4983-84F4-FE04CC1696A5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"c-g とか何も割りあたってないやつを連打して補完メニュー消してみたいなのやってます。Vim8では試してないです","ts":"1635730863.154000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U7HFY4HFY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q=K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51288285-4626-45ce-b932-c6d4b9e1690f","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"僕「`copilot#Accept()`」\nｺﾋﾟﾛｯﾄ「だが断る」","ts":"1635730435.151500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8AdWJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49e6dda2-339f-4730-a376-95c0902c7da0","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"別キーに割り当てられるけど、TABに割り当てられるのを想定しているのか補完メニューが出ているとAcceptできない仕様なのでやはり使いにくい","ts":"1635730285.150600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sZs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a98d833-5d8e-49e9-8497-ff64d487b468","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ドキュメントになかっただけで元々 g:copilot_no_tab_map とかあったのか。","ts":"1635729209.148800","thread_ts":"1635729209.148800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KiX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34723f32-c500-4d45-868a-ccc2256b2291","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"TABキー以外でも別キーを割り当てして展開できるようになったみたいですね。copilot.vim\n\n```        imap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;script\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-J\u0026gt; copilot#Accept(\"\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\")\n        let g:copilot_no_tab_map = v:true```\nあとは b:copilot_disabled が b:copilot_enabled に変更なった？ってくらいですか。下位互換性のために？一応、現状だと b:copilot_disabled も動いてそう","ts":"1635728579.148600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YzU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76f784d0-b14c-488c-90d4-1f29d8457b7d","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"2個目の車輪を作っておいたコピロット\nでもなんか（cocの）補完メニューが被ると描画がおかしくなるのでつかいにくい\n（help読む限り補完pumの方がpopupより上に来そうだけど、なんかチラついてpopupの方が上に来てしまう）","ts":"1635727312.148000","edited":{"user":"U7HFY4HFY","ts":"1635727406.000000"},"files":[{"id":"F02KPMWBW4B","created":1635726858,"timestamp":1635726858,"name":"copilot-popup.mp4","title":"copilot-popup.mp4","mimetype":"video/mp4","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"mp4","pretty_type":"MPEG 4ビデオ","user":"U7HFY4HFY","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":